{"id": "t113-005", "text": "Tendai's band - gig @ the Brudenell Sept 9. me + Rana going, I'm getting tix", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "band", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig @ the Brudenell", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sept 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t113-010", "text": "Isla's play opens Oct 18, closing night Oct 26. dress rehearsal is the night before opening, she's dreading it - lighting cues still a mess, lead actor has a cold. her boyfriend Rohan doing front of house. her parents coming down from Inverness for opening + staying till the Sunday. text her good luck the 18th, flowers on closing night. ask Nina if she wants to come w me", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 18", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "closing night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 26", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dress rehearsal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before opening", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "lead actor", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down from Inverness", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "till the Sunday", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {