{"id": "t113-015", "text": "need to RSVP Sara & James wedding by 7/1. ceremony 8/16 @ 2pm, reception after @ the barn near her parents' place. brunch the next morning for whoever's staying. Sara said gift list is mostly honeymoon fund - they're doing Japan in Sept. her sister Elena is maid of honour, James's brother best man. ask Sara if plus ones ok + whether there's a coach back to town", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "RSVP Sara & James wedding", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "James", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 7/1", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8/16 @ 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reception", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "brunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next morning", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gift list is mostly honeymoon fund", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "doing Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Sept", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "James", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text