{"id": "t113-040", "text": "Adaeze said her parents' 40th anniv dinner is Dec 12, at the Nigerian place on the high st. whole family flying in from Abuja the day before, her brother Tendai sorting airport pickups. she's stressed - her mum keeps changing the guest list, now 60+. I'm doing the cake. her dad apparently loves jazz, maybe a record as a gift from me. ring her the wk before to see how she's holding up", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th anniv dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 12", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Abuja", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "jazz", "owner": "r4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
