{"id": "t113-046", "text": "spoke to Miriam after the recital. Sara (her daughter) played Chopin, nailed it apparently. she's got another one June 7th. should go to that", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recital", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "another one", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 7th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go to that", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t113-048", "text": "Mateo + Camila - getting married 9/21!! told everyone at Sunday lunch, Camila's mum in tears, his dad opened the fizz. venue still TBC, looking at a vineyard in Sussex + somewhere near her gran in Valencia. engagement drinks Fri 5/9 at theirs. Camila wants me to do a reading, ugh. ask Mateo re save the dates + whether they need help w the website", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/21", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2b", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday lunch"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in tears", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Valencia", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri 5/9", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Mateo re save the dates + whether they need help w the website", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t113-050", "text": "Tendai's nervous abt the battle of the bands Fri - their drummer quit 2 days ago, no warning. Kofi's filling in but only learnt half the set, one rehearsal the night before. winner gets a slot at the summer fest. T's girlfriend Joy says he's not sleeping. text T good luck Fri am, and see how it went the day after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "battle of the bands", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 days ago"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rehearsal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "T", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text T good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "T", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri am", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "see how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
